{"id":956203,"title":"03｜核心三层架构：5 分钟听懂 Gateway-Node-Channel 运行机制","content":"<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/76/c7/76d211c8ea5b2893277a2ac55c8009c7.png?wh=720x402\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>今天，我将用最简单的方式，把 OpenClaw 的三层结构给大家讲明白。</p>\n<p>你好，我是尹会生，本讲钟我将带你学习龙虾的核心骨架——Gateway-Node-Channel 三层架构，这不仅是它的技术心脏，更是它区别于你之前见过的所有“AI助手”的关键。</p>\n<p>首先，咱们得忘掉 ChatGPT 那种一问一答的聊天框。</p>\n<p>想象一下，你想让 AI 帮你干点实事儿，比如查查明天的天气，然后自动记到你的日程表里。</p>\n<p>在传统 AI 助手里，你可能得打开一个网页，或者用一个 App，在里面打字。</p>\n<p>但OpenClaw不一样，它的目标是让你在<strong>任何你习惯聊天的地方</strong>——比如微信、钉钉、WhatsApp ——直接就能命令 AI 干活。</p>\n<p>为了实现这个“无处不在”的体验，它设计了下面这三层结构，就像一栋大楼的<strong>指挥部、执行队和传达室。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键细节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Gateway</td>\n<td>网关：中转用户和大模型的消息</td>\n<td>默认绑定 ws://127.0.0.1:18789</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node</td>\n<td>工作节点：响应用户请求，并通过大模型响应或执行相应工具</td>\n<td>涵盖各类技能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Channel</td>\n<td>消息渠道：连接不同的 IM 工具与人进行交互</td>\n<td>支持不同的即时通讯平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>第一层：Gateway（网关）—— 中央指挥部</strong></p>\n<p>这是整个系统的<strong>大脑和总控中心。<strong>你可以把它想象成一个24小时不休息的</strong>接线总机兼任务调度中心。</strong></p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406413,"user_name":"Johar","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1101969,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"834136A6F64CDC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/d0/91/89123507.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1774883170,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"请求是不是应该是先到gateway 再到具体channel？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1222886,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/a8/e6/54a24332.jpg","nickname":"peterpc","note":"","ucode":"48663EB8299D8A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":683140,"discussion_content":"请求通过channel进来，然后到gateway，gateway再把任务分解调度到node，node执行完毕再通过gateway返回给channel","content_length":136,"likes_number":3,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1775269381,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"云南","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406364,"user_name":"神经蛙","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4477400,"ip_address":"江西","ucode":"AD82B7A515B0FA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/44/51/d8/2d208b30.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1774773483,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"这个PPT的AI 工具老师可以分享一下吗？ 感觉很实用","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1499650,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e2/02/783c2c11.jpg","nickname":"常和森","note":"","ucode":"60A5D5CFC49C10","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":684344,"discussion_content":"Notebooklm ","content_length":11,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1776517347,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406267,"user_name":"Geek001","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4400841,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"4EE1D639AC9C1F","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1774505364,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"图片是用什么Ai生成的嘛\n","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2508630,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/47/56